        ],
        [
          "start",
          "div",
          {}
        ],
        [
          "start",
          "h2",
          {}
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "Why don\u2019t you offer Montana Millionaire or another raffle game more than once per year?"
        ],
        [
          "end",
          "h2"
        ],
        [
          "end",
          "div"
        ],
        [
          "start",
          "div",
          {}
        ],
        [
          "start",
          "p",
          {}
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "The Montana Lottery has a large selection of games available every day of the year. We believe Montana Millionaire is special and successful because it\u2019s exclusive. While we may introduce other raffle games in the future, currently we have made this strategic business decision based on detailed market research and analysis."
        ],
